================================================

1. SkillOpt (https://github.com/microsoft/SkillOpt), commit 79124b3, MIT License.

   Copied or ported from it:
   - envs/templates/alfworld/rollout_no_history.md      (byte-exact copy)
   - envs/templates/alfworld/rollout_with_history.md    (byte-exact copy)
   - envs/templates/alfworld/format.json                (string pieces and verbatim excerpts
                                                         of skillopt/envs/alfworld/rollout.py and
                                                         vendor/{memory,env_manager}.py)
   - envs/splits/alfworld/*.json                        (byte-exact copies of data/alfworld_path_split)
   - the ALFWorld response fallbacks and prompt rendering in envs/alfworld.py (ports of the
     code named in its format.json)

