2. SkillRL (https://github.com/aiming-lab/SkillRL), Apache License 2.0, as vendored by
   SkillOpt 79124b3 under skillopt/envs/alfworld/vendor/.

   - envs/vendor/alfworld_projection.py   (from agent_system/environments/env_package/alfworld/
                                           projection.py; reformatted, logic unchanged)
   - envs/templates/alfworld/format.json  (the history-entry format of agent_system/memory/memory.py
                                           and the observation template of
                                           agent_system/environments/env_manager.py)
   - envs/templates/alfworld/config_tw.yaml (see item 3)
   - the text of envs/templates/alfworld/rollout_{no,with}_history.md originates from SkillRL's
     agent_system/environments/prompts/alfworld.py (SkillOpt keeps it as .md prompt files and
     loads it through skillopt/envs/alfworld/vendor/alfworld_prompts.py)

   Modified files carry a notice of the change in their header. The full license text is in
   LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt in this directory.

3. ALFWorld (https://github.com/alfworld/alfworld), MIT License.

   - envs/templates/alfworld/config_tw.yaml is ALFWorld's TextWorld base config as vendored by
     SkillRL and SkillOpt. skill_bench changes one value (general.training_method 'dagger' ->
     'dqn', so that no AlfredExpert is built); the file header records the change.

