5. WebShop (https://github.com/princeton-nlp/WebShop), commit
   64fa2a5c15c7daa698b9ac93f5bb5437b634c9bd, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Princeton
   Natural Language Processing.

   - envs/templates/webshop_server/server.py drives upstream's SimServer and
     WebAgentTextEnv unchanged inside the server image (envs/templates/webshop_server/
     Dockerfile clones upstream at that commit); its action parsing and the refused
     special search commands are ported into envs/webshop.py.
   - The product data (Hugging Face YWZBrandon/webshop-data, revision
     ce990fff5aee388db2706f07820c578ab68e0453, pinned in protocol.WEBSHOP_DATA) is never
     committed; the image downloads and verifies it. tools/prepare_webshop.py writes the
     split manifests under envs/splits/webshop/ from upstream's
     baseline_models/data/human_goals.json and items_human_ins.json and the server's dump.

